{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Calabi--丘流形"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Calabi–丘流形”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>Calabi–丘流形是 Ricci 平坦的紧 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kähler流形","text":"Kähler 流形"}},{"Plain":". 其"},{"Local":{"url":"典范丛","text":"典范丛"}},{"Plain":"平凡, 第一"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":"消失.</p>\n<p>Calabi–丘流形可视为 "},{"Local":{"url":"K3曲面","text":"K3 曲面"}},{"Plain":"的推广.</p>\n<p>Calabi–丘流形的"},{"Local":{"url":"和乐","text":"和乐"}},{"Plain":"属于 $SU(n)$.</p>\n<h2>代数簇</h2>\n<p>设 $X$ 为 $k$ 上的光滑射影代数簇, 若"},{"Local":{"url":"典范层","text":"典范丛"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathscr K_X\\simeq \\mathscr O_X$, 则称其为 <strong>Calabi–丘</strong>的.</p>\n"}]}}